00:14:56.410 --> 00:15:00.870
This calls for an all-out attack to drag her out at any cost!

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:05.180
We'll call you when we catch her, okay?

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:06.880
That's when you come in
 from the veranda.

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:09.220
Sit tight until then.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.190
Okay.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.140
Shall we proceed?

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:18.640
Kazuki's Room - Please Knock

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:22.950
 Get out here, Kazuki!

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:28.160
Oh, so <i>that's</i> what you were up to...

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.370
I must say, those clothes do fit you well.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:36.230
I'm only changing because my clothes got dirty!

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:39.660
Being photogenic has nothing to do with it!

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.200
It's called "suspiciously specific denial."

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:44.050
Self-destruction.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:45.650
You wanted to get photographed.

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:47.710
Onee-chan too, come on!

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:51.480
Kazuki, summon your fighting spirit 
and tell Yuu-chin the truth.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:54.420
I don't need any fighting spirit!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:56.430
But I'm full of it!

00:15:57.270 --> 00:15:59.350
Oh, nice pose there.

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:03.480
Hang on, I'll set this camera to maximum resolution.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:06.550
Now, to tweak the shutter speed a bit...

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:08.690
You don't know how hard you fail! {more interesting than: "You... jerk!"}

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.190
<i>This is </i>not<i> good.</i>

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:13.700
All set! Now look this way.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:15.450
You don't need to take-

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.420
Hold on, you two.

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:20.380
Come on, I think we all need to cool down.

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:22.020
Put this on.

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:25.670
I told you not to come in 
until we called you. So get out.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.710
But I thought I could get a great shot.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.440
Can't you see that Kazuki is angry?

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.170
I think you'd better go now.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:34.790
<i>Punching him would've been faster.</i>

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:36.740
You done goofed, Yuu-chin.

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:39.960
You shouldn't do things that piss girls off.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:43.570
Hmm, if you say so, Chihaya-chan... {"If Chihaya-san says so" *facepalm*}

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.800
Oh, good boy!

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:48.490
Time for us to make our exit.

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:50.330
Okay!

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.820
Get out while the getting's good.

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:59.040
He's not so twisted after all.

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:02.080
You should calm down too.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:05.010
I'll be waiting for you in the garden.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:22.170
See ya, Yuu-chin!

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:23.530
Bye bye!

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:25.360
Okay, see you later.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.340
You done goofed, Yuu-chin.

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:37.640
You shouldn't do things that piss girls off.

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:41.300
Hmm, if you say so, Chihaya-chan... {"If Chihaya-san says so" *facepalm*}

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.070
Why didn't you come out?

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:49.400
I didn't even get to take one photo of you.

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:52.260
Oh, I <i>know</i> what kind of nasty pictures
 <i>you</i> wanted to take.{I assumed you just wanted to take some perverted photos.}

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:55.630
Why do you say that? 
Chihaya-chan is worried about you, too.

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.730
You'd better apologize to her.

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:00.350
Why are you still taking pictures of me?

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:02.920
This is your punishment for killing the mood.

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:06.310
Your angry face will be
 preserved on film forever.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:08.500
Stop that!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:11.420
No way. If you don't want 
these photos to look weird,

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.320
then turn this way and show me a smile.

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:17.860
Come on. Time's ticking and this shutter's clicking!

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.100
Break a smile and look in my direction, Kazuki!

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:25.580
Forget it! I'm totally not cute anyway!

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:32.930
Kazuki! I forgot something...

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:44.250
Things have taken a turn for the worse.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.850
Hmmm, I'm a bit worried.

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:51.880
What's wrong? Yuu-chin, 
did you do something to Kazuki?

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:57.280
All I did was try to photograph her, since I didn't get the chance before.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:02.870
That's all? And here I thought you were taking some perverted pictures.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.840
How about I take them?

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.310
I may not have the skills,

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:12.150
but they say photographers can
 feed off their feelings for the subject.

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:17.510
And since I like Kazuki very much, 
 I can take a very good picture.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.470
All right, I surrender.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:22.780
All right, I surrender.

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:26.720
Yes! It's more fun when we all get along.

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:29.730
Please lean on the railing over there.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:30.860
Here?

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:31.730
Yes.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:36.740
Ah, I can't put my finger on what this picture's missing.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:38.750
Want me to take a look at the shot?

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:43.000
Ahh, Yuu-chin. Go ahead and stand next to Kazuki.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:46.560
W-Why?

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:51.070
The picture's missing something. And Yuu-chin didn't take a single photo of himself.

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:53.110
So, line up, you two.

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:54.330
Oh.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:57.210
Stay away from me!
 I don't wanna do this!

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.520
So she says, but...

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:02.470
Time to heat things up! Go!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:03.060
Time to heat things up! Go!

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:08.770
Good, now stay real close,
 and look over here.

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:11.340
Then again, maybe we shouldn't.

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:14.730
We can't stop now! Come on, Kazuki, smile for the camera.

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:16.730
Something wrong?

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:19.180
Why are you so pushy?

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:22.890
Ah, sorry. Did I overdo it?

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:25.070
I'll take one of you two in a normal pose.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:28.840
But why do I have to appear in a photo with Yuuji?

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:30.730
Doesn't no mean no?!

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:33.250
T-Then we-can do solo shots.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:36.010
I'm too mad to have any pictures taken now!

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:39.290
Aw, c'mon, don't be like that...

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:42.140
Hey, Kazuki. Don't take it out
 on Chihaya-chan.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:45.760
I can't let her take the blame when she didn't have any ill intentions.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.050
If you want to be angry with someone, 
just be angry with me.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:49.980
I'll apologize.

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:53.180
I really have been
 teasing you too much lately.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:56.280
I don't need to be in any of these pictures.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:58.750
Let's be friends again.

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:01.860
Sorry, I got carried away.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.510
No, no, it's all my fault. 
Don't blame yourself.

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:07.200
So cheer up and enjoy yourself, okay?

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:12.050
Maybe you all would enjoy
yourselves more if I weren't here.

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:15.450
Wait... Kazuki!

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:18.790
Screw it, I take back everything I said! 
 You can have my apology...

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:20.510
...from my cold, dead fingers!

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:21.720
Yuu-chin!

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:24.910
Yeah, without you around, Kazuki, 
we might have some fun for a change.

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:28.010
Go away and sulk until you can't sulk any more.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.340
Y-Yuu-chin, stop it...

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:32.030
I really hate you, Kazuki!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:38.690
I understand. You hate me too, Yuuji.

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:42.870
I won't ever speak with you again. 
Let's break up!

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:44.240
Kazuki!

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:44.900
Kazuki!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.740
What's with you, Yuu-chin?!

00:21:52.250 --> 00:21:54.040
Yuu-chin...

